WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.202
-We have actually have children
who are very close in age.

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:04.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think your son is two months
older than my son.

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:05.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wow.
So your son's 14 months?

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:06.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, 14 months.
-Oh, okay.

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So congratulations.
You had not put any photos

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:09.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
of your son on social media,
but you just did.

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:10.610 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-For over a year.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.746 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Congratulations.
You made it longer than I did.

00:00:12.746 --> 00:00:15.281 size:84% position:42%
I had the plan not to.
-Yeah? And why did you?

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:16.282 line:92%
-'Cause it was just, like,

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:18.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
the world needs to see
this little angel.

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:20.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This amazing gorgeous thing?
-Yeah, yeah.

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:21.654 line:92%
-Well, mine -- It wasn't so much

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:24.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I was itching
for the world to see him.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:25.392 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I went to a restaurant

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:28.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
for Father's Day
with my son and my dad.

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:29.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Very sweet.
-And we --

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:32.699 size:75% position:38%
It was by the ocean,
and my son was like,

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:34.300 size:78% position:39% line:92%
"Awa! Awa! Awa! Awa!"

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.535 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Water.
-Yeah.

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:36.236 line:92%
-And so I was like, okay,

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:37.637
you're going to get in the water
for the first time.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:40.907 align:start size:94% position:6%
I slathered him with, like,
sun, you know, screen.

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:42.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was looking purple,
'cause he's black.

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:44.477 align:start size:94% position:6%
When we put on sunscreen,
we look purple.

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:46.346 line:92%
And he just was looking crazy.

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:48.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
Got slammed by waves.
Sand everywhere.

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.183 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're leaving.
Paparazzi -- Chk-Chk-Chk-Chk!

00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:54.120
And I'm trying to hide him
with a blanket, and I'm like --

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
I pull over to the gas station
after they get the shot.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.792 line:92%
I text his dad, and I'm like,

00:00:58.792 --> 00:01:00.193 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I got to put this picture out
before the paparazzi.

00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:03.363
I don't want them to make money
off of our child and
have the first picture."

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:05.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You wanted to beat 'em
to the punch. Yeah.

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.133 line:92%
-So I post the damn picture.

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:09.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
Next day,
ain't no paparazzi pictures,

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:11.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause Mama knew
how to hide that camera.

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:13.740 line:92%
She's a supermodel for a reason!

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so now his picture
is out there,

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:17.410
and I didn't need it to be!
-You didn't need to do it.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:21.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
But this --
You have a beautiful baby.

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:23.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's something else.
-Aww. Thank you.

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:24.317 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience awws ]

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:27.320 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, I know that
you've sort of popularized

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.489 size:84% position:42%
the idea of smizing,
smiling with your eyes.

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:32.459
It seems like that's what
your son is doing here.

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:32.992 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I know!

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:35.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did he learn
how to smize from you?

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:36.362 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-I am not a stage mom.

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:37.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't want you to think
that I am saying,

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:40.200
"You ain't gonna get no peas and
carrots if you don't smize!"

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, he just has
that natural thing,

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:43.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I had it
when I was young, too.

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:46.005 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I do not
want him to model, Lord.

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:47.273 size:81% position:41% line:92%
But he has that thing.

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:49.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
Look at him.
He's like, "Hello..."

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:49.843 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Yeah, no. It's very --

00:01:49.843 --> 00:01:51.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I am smizing."
-It, like, pulls me in.

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:54.481
I'm like, "Whatever you want me
to do, I'm there."

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:57.317
Well, congratulations on him.
Congratulations on your show.

00:01:57.317 --> 00:01:59.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you. Thank you.
-So lovely to have you here.

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:02.021 size:81% position:41%
Tyra Banks, everybody.
"America's Got Talent"

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:05.492 align:start size:94% position:6%
airs Tuesday nights
at 8:00 p.m. on NBC.

